  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match the List-I with List-II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>List I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>List II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>AC generator</td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td>Presence of both L and C</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>Transformer</td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td>Electromagnetic Induction</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>Resonance phenomenon to occur</td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td>Quality factor</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>Sharpness of resonance</td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td>Mutual Inductance</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>"
  },
